ion is left to chance, or some primary element of a composed work's realization is left to the determination of its performer(s), or both. The term is most often associated with procedures in which the chance element involves a relatively limited number of possibilities.", "extract_html": "<p><b>Aleatoric</b> <b>music</b> is music in which some element of the composition is left to chance, or some primary element of a composed work's realization is left to the determination of its performer(s), or both. The term is most often associated with procedures in which the chance element involves a relatively limited number of possibilities.</p>"}